    "Fresh default Router bootstrap has valid routes and nonzero quotes for all 16 assets at the pinned block, including GOOGLB and CRCLB (absent from the old live Router registry).",
    "Functional regression ran 105 tests across inherited suites (41 distinct cases), followed by 2 deployment/bootstrap cases (42 distinct functional cases total)."
